  "body": "Viewing By Appointment\r\n\r\nYES! You want the 360-degree sea views but you don't want the multi-million dollar price tag? This could well be what you're looking for...\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned with a peaceful outlook, Apartment 305 offers easy, low-maintenance living just moments from Long Bay Village, the beach, and coastal walkways.\r\n\r\nThis quality apartment stands out from the rest, offering two generous bedrooms plus a dedicated office and access to the stunning residents' lounge, where sweeping 360-degree sea views create one of the most enjoyable aspects of life at Beach & Cavalli. Whether entertaining friends, enjoying a quiet coffee, or simply taking in the outlook, this beautiful shared space feels like an extension of your home.\r\n\r\nLight-filled open-plan living creates a warm and inviting atmosphere, while quality finishes throughout reflect the calibre of this sought-after development.\r\n\r\nAdding further appeal are two secure car parks, a rare and valuable feature, along with ample visitor-parking for family and friends.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love It:\r\n\r\n* Quality apartment in the sought-after Beach & Cavalli Residences\r\n* Two spacious bedrooms plus a dedicated office\r\n* Access to the stunning top-floor residents' lounge with spectacular sea views\r\n* Two secure car parks - a rare and valuable bonus\r\n* Ample visitor parking\r\n* Peaceful, private outlook\r\n* Light-filled open-plan living\r\n* Residents' lounge complete with library and kitchen facilities\r\n* Easy walk to Long Bay Village, beach and coastal walkways\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a stylish home, a lock-and-leave lifestyle or a smart investment, this apartment offers space, quality and location in equal measure.\r\n\r\nOpportunities in Beach & Cavalli are tightly held. Secure your place in this exceptional coastal community today.\r\n\r\nPlease contact us to request the documents.\r\n\r\n206/64 Te Oneroa Way, Long Bay\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34916",
